{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"X将旧日生活与归属感较集中地具体化为不设防的亲近、信任和被接纳，略微收窄了怀念对象的范围。\",\n    \"部分段落暂时沉浸于理想生活带来的内心满足，使现实行动与怀念的拉扯短暂减弱。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"Y的主线逐渐转向离开旧生活后是否应该回去，以及如何面对孤独、避免再次受委屈；这更接近去留抉择，而不是维持尊严的行动与怀念之间的持续拉扯。\",\n    \"Y虽然保留了不愿再忍受屈辱的立场，但维持尊严主要表现为不回头、不再委屈自己，缺少主动采取行动保护珍视生活的持续过程。\",\n    \"Y对旧日生活和归属的怀念十分充分，但它与行动的关系主要是回归冲动和自我保护之间的冲突，替代了 Center 中行动与怀念相互牵动、反复改变的关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X同时包含主动承担、争取珍爱之物的行动，以及对旧日亲近生活和归属的怀念，两者从犹豫、投入、疲惫到重新行动始终交织变化。Y虽然也有尊严与怀念两方面，但实际讲述的更主要是离开之后的失落、是否回归以及如何独自生活，主线偏向相邻的去留与自我保护问题。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "31fdd588-21d2-4d23-a542-19a32206c6f5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T074530546559Z", "elapsed_seconds": 17.735, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:45:48.290146+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "dd05961dc2da2af14874f8f6faddec9dc945051006099231fa521b410e92106e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web